This directory's data was generated using ColabFold. The original sequence was retrieved from the [amino acid sequence](https://www.rcsb.org/fasta/entry/3UJZ/display) provided in [NIH structure 3UJZ](https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/Structure/pdb/3UJZ), which was a supplementary material in [Zhu et al.](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/22483117/).

It was generated using [YoshitakaMolocalcolabfold](https://github.com/YoshitakaMo/localcolabfold) with the default hyperparameters from the [sample run script](https://github.com/YoshitakaMo/localcolabfold/blob/main/run_colabfoldbatch_sample.sh):

```bash
colabfold_batch \
  --num-recycle 3 \
  --amber \
  --templates \
  --use-gpu-relax \
  --num-models 5 \
  --model-order 1,2,3,4,5 \
  --random-seed 0 \
  3UJZ.fasta \
  3UJZ
```
